SUMMARY:Introduction to Blues Guitar 
DESCRIPTION:This is a paid Adult School class. Click here to 
 register.\n\nLearn the basics of playing the blues! Students will learn 
 basic rhythm and chord playing as well as the Pentatonic/Blues scale. Learn 
 how to do basic improvising and be ready to jam with your friends! Bring 
 your guitar to class. Acoustic or electric welcome\, but there will be no 
 amplifiers available.\n\nPrerequisite: This class is not for complete 
 beginners\, students should already know all basic open chords. \n
LOCATION:Montclair Main - Conference Room\, Montclair Public Library
ORGANIZER;CN="Montclair Adult School":MAILTO:adultschool@montclairlibrary.org
CATEGORIES:Adult School, Music
