SUMMARY:[MILL Senior Friday] Bereavement Group
DESCRIPTION:Join us on Fridays for a day full of events for Seniors with 
 the MILL @ MPL! All events are free and open to the public. Registration is 
 recommended unless otherwise noted.\n\n\nThis group being facilitated by 
 Lisy\, our Health Department Senior Services Social Worker. All are welcome 
 who have experienced loss of a loved one. \n\nHOW TO REGISTER\nThis class 
 is run by the MILL. Please register for classes directly through their 
 website here.\n\nFor questions about MILL classes please call 
 973-744-3278.\n\nMILL @ MPL is made possible through a partnership between 
 the MILL\, Montclair Public Library and Partners for Health.
