SUMMARY:Movie Matinee: Little Women (2019)
DESCRIPTION:September's movie matinees are for those excited for the first 
 day of Autumn (Sept. 22)\, light cardigans and crisp mornings. Get cozy and 
 join us at the library for some Fall favorites!\n\n\nLittle Women (2019) | 
 PG\n\nFour sisters learn about love\, life\, and loss as they grow through 
 their young womanhood against the backdrop of post-Civil War America. At 
 the heart of the family is the headstrong Jo who aspires\, above all else\, 
 to forge her own path. Based on the novel by Louisa May Alcott. Watch the 
 trailer here.\n\nSeating is first come\, first served. Registration is not 
 required\, but recommended for reminders and updates
