SUMMARY:Film Club - Online
DESCRIPTION:This is a paid Adult School class. \n\nDo you love movies? Do 
 you wish you had others to discuss them with after watching?  See assigned 
 movies\, which may be on Netflix\, Amazon Prime\, Hulu or on demand\, then 
 join classmates to talk about themes\, plot\, characters\, acting\, 
 directing\, cinematography\, costumes\, score\, trailers and/or viewer’s 
 expectations.\n\nZoom Link will be sent weekly from Instructor. Students 
 will view one movie on their own for each class (sometimes a series may be 
 assigned). Instructor will email students one week before the first 
 class.\n\nClass takes place 9/16\, 10/7\, 10/21\, 11/4\, 11/18\, 12/9
