SUMMARY:Friends of the Bellevue Ave. Library present Book Sale & Community Yard Sale Fundraiser
DESCRIPTION:Please register ONLY IF YOU INTEND ON PARTICIPATING \n\nas a 
 vendor in the yard sale!\n\nThe details:\n\n\n	EarlySpecial is $10 cash or 
 check (until September 5th!) \n	After 9/05/2026\, participation fee will be 
 $20 cash or check.\n	Participation fee needs to be paid onsite either at 
 the circulation desk or the day of the sale directly to FBAL's president. 
 \n	Please provide your own table or blanket.\n	This is an outdoor event! 
 Please provide best contact should we need to reach you in the event of 
 rain!\n	Thank you so much for supporting the Bellevue Avenue Branch (the 
 BAB)! \n\n\n \n\nConsider joining the Friends of the Bellevue Ave. 
 Library.\n\n
