SUMMARY:Good Fortune Cookies: Talk\, Make\, Taste and Give Away! NEW
DESCRIPTION:This is a paid Adult School class. Click here to 
 register.\n\nLed by Nancy Loo of Dumpling Diplomacy. Part of our community 
 read\, Montclair Reads "The Sum of Us." Write out your own good fortunes\, 
 learn to wrap them in fortune cookies\, and give them away to friends\, 
 family members and strangers to build what McGhee calls "the Dividend of 
 Solidarity"! Space is limited.
LOCATION:Montclair Main - Auditorium\, Montclair Public Library
