SUMMARY:Basic Italian 1 - Online
DESCRIPTION:This is a paid Adult School class. Click here to 
 register.\n\nLearn to communicate effectively in Italian in everyday 
 situations through interactive lessons while enriching your understanding 
 and appreciation of Italian culture. This course is for beginners and those 
 who need a review of basic grammar\, everyday expressions and essential 
 vocabulary.  It is also appropriate for speakers of other Romance languages 
 who want to learn Italian easily and quickly.\n\n \n
LOCATION:Montclair - Offsite\, Montclair Public Library
ORGANIZER;CN="Montclair Adult School":MAILTO:adultschool@montclairlibrary.org
