SUMMARY:Italian for Travelers - Online
DESCRIPTION:This is a paid Adult School class. Click here to 
 register.\n\nTraveling to Italy?  Learn essential Italian for the savvy 
 traveler through thematic lessons in which you will greet others and 
 exchange basic information\, make reservations for hotel rooms and 
 restaurants\, order food and drink\, ask directions\, handle transactions 
 in Euros\, use public transportation\, and converse on a variety of topics 
 that will prepare you for your trip abroad. Develop the ability to 
 communicate effectively in Italian while deepening your understanding of 
 Italian culture and picking up useful travel tips that will save you time 
 and money.\n
LOCATION:Montclair Public Library
ORGANIZER;CN="Montclair Adult School":MAILTO:adultschool@montclairlibrary.org
CATEGORIES:Adult School, Language
