DTSTART:20260922T193000Z
DTEND:20260922T201500Z
DTSTAMP:20260922T000000Z
SUMMARY:Tech Talks: Why Is Everything a Subscription Now?
DESCRIPTION:Tech Talks is a free informational series where library staff 
 introduce and explain the technology topics that matter most in today's 
 digital world. Each session takes a closer look at a new or complex 
 topic—whether it's a trending app\, an emerging technology\, or a 
 platform you've been hearing about but aren't quite sure how to navigate. 
 Through demonstrations and clear\, jargon-free explanations\, you'll come 
 away with a better understanding of the tech landscape around you. There's 
 no hands-on component\, so no devices are needed—just come ready to learn 
 and ask questions.\n\nAll are welcome regardless of experience level\, and 
 time is reserved at the end of each session for Q&A. Sessions are free and 
 open to the public.\n\nThis week's topic is: \n\nWhy Is Everything a 
 Subscription Now?
LOCATION:Montclair Main - Classroom
ORGANIZER;CN="Montclair Library":MAILTO:events@montclairlibrary.org
CATEGORIES:Adult Services, Computers & Technology
UID:LibCal-10306-17087263
URL:https://bccls.libcal.com/event/17087263
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTART:20260922T220000Z
DTEND:20260922T233000Z
DTSTAMP:20260922T000000Z
SUMMARY:After the Harvest: Preserving your bounty for the winter
DESCRIPTION:AFTER THE HARVEST (PRESERVING YOUR BOUNTY FOR THE 
 WINTER)\n\nThe thrust of our After the Harvest talk/lecture is:\n\nTo 
 provide basic information on how to preserve your garden harvest.\n\nA. 
 Canning\, Jarring\, Pickling and Dehydration\n\nB. Storage of root 
 crops\n\nC. Freezing and cubing vegetables\n\nD. Making jams and 
 jellies\n\nE. storing the your harvest in a dark pantry\, basement\, or 
 root cellar\n\n(includes slideshow and hand-outs)
LOCATION:Montclair Bellevue Ave Branch - Classroom\, Montclair Bellevue Ave Branch - First Floor
ORGANIZER;CN="Montclair Bellevue Avenue Branch":MAILTO:branch-events@montclairlibrary.org
CATEGORIES:Bellevue Avenue Branch, Culinary, Home & Garden, Talk, Lecture
