SUMMARY:Google NotebookLM for Real Life: Turn Your Sources Into Study Guides\, Briefings\, Podcasts\, and Plans NEW
DESCRIPTION:This is a paid Adult School class. Click here to 
 register.\n\nTurn your own trusted sources into useful\, engaging content 
 with Google NotebookLM. In this hands-on 90-minute class\, you’ll learn 
 how to organize and explore source materials\, ask questions\, generate 
 summaries and study guides\, and create audio overviews\, presentations\, 
 and other practical resources. Bring your laptop and a topic or project 
 you’d like to develop—no advanced AI experience required.\n\nBe 
 prepared with links\, PDFs\, slide decks\, and other sources to build out 
 your Notebook.
