SUMMARY:Wine Confidence 101
DESCRIPTION:This is a paid Adult School class. Click here to 
 register.\n\nBuild your wine confidence in just four weeks. Whether you are 
 new to wine or already a\nconnoisseur\, this approachable course will give 
 you the knowledge\, tasting skills\, and\nvocabulary to enjoy wine more 
 fully—and choose it more confidently.\n\nThroughout this 4-week course\, 
 you will explore the world’s primary grape varieties and\ndiscover the 
 many styles of white\, rosé\, red\, and sparkling wines. We will break 
 down\nthe basics of viticulture and winemaking so you can understand how 
 grapes\, regions\,\nand production choices shape the flavors\, aromas\, 
 body\, and texture in every glass. You\nwill also learn what makes the 
 major wine-producing countries distinctive and how to\nrecognize key 
 differences among grape varieties and wine styles.\n\nEach session includes 
 guided tasting practice\, from visual assessment through aroma\,\nflavor\, 
 structure\, and finish\, helping you evaluate wine and learn why you like 
 or dislike\ndifferent wines. Durin the 4 weeks\, we will taste 20–25 
 wines from around the world\,\nmaking this class both educational and 
 delicious. By the end\, you will feel more\ncomfortable ordering\, buying\, 
 discussing\, and enjoying wine in any setting.\n\nTHIS EVENT IS 21  
 Students will be required to show a government ID to the instructor\nupon 
 arriving at the first session.\n
LOCATION:Montclair - Cornerstone Montclair\, Montclair Public Library
ORGANIZER;CN="Montclair Adult School":MAILTO:adultschool@montclairlibrary.org
CATEGORIES:Adult School, Culinary
