SUMMARY:Garden Qigong at Van Vleck
DESCRIPTION:Note: This is a paid Adult School class. Click here to 
 register.\n\nJoin us to explore Qigong in the Van Vleck gardens as we 
 transition from summer to autumn. Learn to move with gracefulness and joy 
 while remaining centered and rooted. This 6-week class highlights the 
 gentle rhythms of Qigong by slowing down\, listening and mind/body 
 peacefulness. Come pay attention to your senses as we move with care\, 
 cultivate attention and let each breath carry us home. \n\n \n
