SUMMARY:Fall Container Gardening and Seed Starting NEW
DESCRIPTION:This is a paid Adult School class. Click here to 
 register.\n\nKickstart your fall garden with confidence by learning how to 
 grow fresh vegetables in containers\, no matter the space you have! In this 
 hands-on workshop\, you’ll learn how to care for and plant an edible crop 
 to take home and nurture all season long.\n\nLearn the art of harvesting\, 
