SUMMARY:Retirement Lunch and Learn
DESCRIPTION:Come join financial consultants from Equitable Advisors for a 
 lunch and learn as we discuss maximizing your retirement income. Learn 
 practical strategies for managing savings and creating a sustainable plan 
 for long-term financial security. We'll help you stay informed by covering 
 key tax law updates and new legislation that may impact your financial 
 picture. This session is designed to provide valuable insights and serve as 
 a trusted resource in navigating your financial future with confidence.\n\n 
