SUMMARY:Craft & Chat
DESCRIPTION:Bring your current project and join fellow makers for a relaxed 
 afternoon of creativity and conversation. Whether you enjoy knitting\, 
 crocheting\, embroidery\, needlepoint\, quilting\, drawing\, or other 
 portable crafts\, this is a welcoming space to work on your projects\, 
 share ideas\, and connect with others who love to create.\n\nThere is no 
 instructor and no formal program—just an opportunity to craft in the 
 company of others. All skill levels are welcome. Please feel free to bring 
 your own project and supplies\, or explore the assortment of donated craft 
 supplies available to use during the program. Supplies vary and are 
 available while they last.\n\nEvery first and third Monday of the month. 
 Registration is recommended for updates.\n
